provenance.sourcePrompt:
5s, 1920x1080, SILENT. Image background Ken Burns. Top-right corner: "London" in Righteous font 45px, white with offset shadow + 45-degree hatching stripe pseudo-element animation on the shadow layer, exactly matching the provided CSS pattern. Fades in then fades out
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Righteous&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*,*:before,*:after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
body,#scene{width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:#000;}
#scene{position:relative;}
@keyframes kb{from{transform:scale(1.0)}to{transform:scale(1.04)}}
#bg{
position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%
object-fit:cover;z-index:1
transform-origin:50% 50%
animation:kb 5s linear forwards
}
#grad{
position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;width:100%;height:45%;z-index:2
background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(0,0,0,0.70) 0%,transparent 100%)
}
/* tag wrapper — top right */
@keyframes tagIn{
0%  {opacity:0;transform:translateY(-10px);}
18% {opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
80% {opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
100%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-10px);}
}
#tag{
position:absolute
top:68px;right:84px
z-index:10
animation:tagIn 4.7s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1) 0.25s both
}
/* h1 matching the provided CSS pattern — Righteous, text-shadow offset, pseudo stripe */
#tag h1{
display:inline-block
color:#ffffff
font-family:'Righteous',serif
font-size:45px
line-height:1
letter-spacing:.04em
text-transform:uppercase
text-shadow:.03em .03em 0 rgba(60,80,180,0.55)
position:relative
}
#tag h1:after{
content:attr(data-shadow)
position:absolute
top:.06em;left:.06em
z-index:-1
text-shadow:none
background-image:linear-gradient(
45deg
transparent 45%
rgba(220,215,200,0.80) 45%
rgba(220,215,200,0.80) 55%
transparent 0
)
background-size:.05em .05em
webkit-background-clip:text
background-clip:text
webkit-text-fill-color:transparent
color:transparent
animation:shad-anim 15s linear infinite
}
@keyframes shad-anim{
0%  {background-position:0 0}
100%{background-position:100% -100%}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="scene">
<img id="bg" src="{{bgImg}}" alt="">
<div id="grad"></div>
<div id="tag">
<h1 data-shadow="London">London</h1>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
```
